CATHY HELP

Create • Protect • Restore

Usage:
  cathy [options] filename

Options:
  -q   quiet
  -r   raw mode
  -x   no chmod +x
  -n   dry run
  -c   clean CRLF
  -b   no backup
  -p   show path
  -i   insert mode
  -v   version
  -h   help

Cathy is a POSIX shell utility designed for:
- normal Linux
- BusyBox
- recovery shells
- limited environments
